      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "回到自己房间，再次检查起资料。下次比赛，莱茵力量\n和西沙里奥应该会共同参加三后冠的第二战『橡树杯』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6215e20c68eab3626d8c5f5bc2df0d4cfad31dfc2102a592157e564f5be64e3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
