    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53aeb210588bec093abb8092",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『“稀世的女王们”――今晚我们来听听，\n作为最优秀古马级女王赛马娘，熠熠生辉的她们说的宝贵话语吧』",
      "source_fingerprint": "710d0634d66d709916045f60960078b704520a1cf1be8e39af52a56f8fdb4424",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0201/storytimeline_020201101.json",
      "json_path": [
