      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――对于期待，我可以说是『辜负』了吧。中兴之祖的祖母，\n以及三后冠夺得二冠的母亲，作为继承她们血脉之人――",
      "source_fingerprint": "c431f527f300150ea064bf254c3e25b4f137620d906233b565e64a3c46e2649d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
