      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "作为高贵的“华丽一族”的后继者。我背负着达成三后冠的\n巨大期待，然而却没能实现，这是事实。",
      "source_fingerprint": "abb607d572fe167631bf07cac0168b32cd4409d9e90fca304f7168a6c4f2cbbb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
