    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26fe9207085ff3f0f63178ae",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如大家所知，相比王道的中距离路线，当时短距离的关注度相差甚远。\n很多人对于我转向短距离路线表示失望。――但是。",
      "source_fingerprint": "600c1662b567879c5f5668d73bf6a0747125822fbc2c95b5f0f04765016c4c67",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0201/storytimeline_020201101.json",
      "json_path": [
