    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c8e7d9e1997e222047a2f05",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b56cd884b7441b8b32119740e379b8bc7aa840838b1c62bd9418c4a41cbf2b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0201/storytimeline_020201101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b363eb306852ca9e3bb4378",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我下定决心，唯有这条道路――才是我的使命，才是让我发挥热情的地方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "451ecca0e80ef9b2b00247c735a838af4c2ff8e2fd3d5f66116b39ca115b9468",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0201/storytimeline_020201101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48f495223a9f51af817de540",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石。制霸『安田纪念』以及『短途马锦标』，\n展示了自身高贵的血脉，和其中寄宿着的至高『速度』的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54090483b0945af9ff445b2ad1ae86cd4b6f5451388fddb89a4812b9d4455214",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0201/storytimeline_020201101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e01c57f2ef5ec7258a2c2262",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "生野狄杜斯",
      "source_fingerprint": "73591e968e6e55add318c6642876a233b71c9133534f118cf16308ba9278213c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0201/storytimeline_020201101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:888b9078934a798928db6fc1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――我认为，自己没有什么杰出的素质与才能。\n与其他的各位不同，我并没有实现GⅠ中的胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b2afbfb1a0f0001864ba9f69ae1db54757b25f8ce9f403826dcaa4ee71fb25b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0201/storytimeline_020201101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4701ff86b1e835bad1206da6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "生野狄杜斯",
      "source_fingerprint": "73591e968e6e55add318c6642876a233b71c9133534f118cf16308ba9278213c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0201/storytimeline_020201101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54e0effd8030113129de324b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是，引以为豪的东西，我确实拥有。\n请教身边的大家，而磨炼出来的，属于我的强大。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d211b729a35920d7b14b8cf593631fc2fc3908768ea2044d3d53905bf1e3791",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0201/storytimeline_020201101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c20b3fa0203d541a7256209e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "生野狄杜斯",
      "source_fingerprint": "73591e968e6e55add318c6642876a233b71c9133534f118cf16308ba9278213c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0201/storytimeline_020201101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6fb18d02cbf00cb30bc3cec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我可以很自豪地说，『管理能力』，就是我的武器。\n在这群英荟萃、高手云集的比赛界，能让我绽放光芒的――我的武器。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2158c931dd475f079f3d94d923f2588b9e19522efcac667a2e3cab4ba91f853",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0201/storytimeline_020201101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e82e8f92c9c1a2846cd76f4b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "生野狄杜斯",
      "source_fingerprint": "73591e968e6e55add318c6642876a233b71c9133534f118cf16308ba9278213c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0201/storytimeline_020201101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bc095e485d5579561c9438c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "保持状态，哪怕是片刻。英勇善战，哪怕多一场比赛。\n然后――去赢得一道又一道的荣光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8855929afcadf68f5c8a2aa7b50ea3b1fd6db13be00ec8a316c18e5948dab48",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0201/storytimeline_020201101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9659aeb44674bd6fba17002",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "生野狄杜斯",
      "source_fingerprint": "73591e968e6e55add318c6642876a233b71c9133534f118cf16308ba9278213c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0201/storytimeline_020201101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e229c7a04db126798981737",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以『管理能力』这一武器，达成我的理想。\n……我为贯彻了自己的意志而感到骄傲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b9097218e9286c043b96500c2e4560311c146fa7ca6b069a3bc8e2977789569",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0201/storytimeline_020201101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
