    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7968355b183652e7865fd47",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（我心里清楚。距离变得越长，对莱茵来说\n就越困难。『橡树杯』，2400m……会很吃力）",
      "source_fingerprint": "59563cd3773d77490c7a3414791a8097d0049361d3be2e4b5687125e841e4151",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0201/storytimeline_020201101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c2557ff164ed98bc04532db",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "生野狄杜斯。在闪耀系列赛中\n以无伤病的状态历战51场比赛――",
      "source_fingerprint": "278142954b4bfb97254012723c3db93a891fc8e2e3a0983791dfaf6dc49187ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0201/storytimeline_020201101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9173274677713f5254214c22",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从『安田纪念』到『宝冢纪念』。在3周的时间内连战GⅠ这一严峻的\n日程下，取得了双第二名的好成绩，拥有钢铁般肉体与精神的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "679973067bc06a551768f79448e0d376cb826d67415962a35920e4f7d4045a94",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0201/storytimeline_020201101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcb0656350bce1ba767cd3be",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菱亚马逊",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e46e1b1d0b91c1ce1fa11c6823587aa41504c815d8da191f269c6fd336b6c12",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0201/storytimeline_020201101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:342f6866b35d1c6ac92474f5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――『稀世女王』什么的，真是给了我个\n夸张的称号呢。老实说，我没想过那些复杂的事！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1a6f1e2c3e1b0de3d775e977557f81213821f6594a4bbea5e3452c3c509d783",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0201/storytimeline_020201101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73785768b3e131636ee369dc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菱亚马逊",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e46e1b1d0b91c1ce1fa11c6823587aa41504c815d8da191f269c6fd336b6c12",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
